### Why?

Customer support agents currently handle roughly 400 status updates per week over email, with each hand-off taking 20–40 minutes and sometimes getting lost. Enabling agents to set an order to `Shipped` directly removes most of that manual work and reduces the delay between dispatch and the customer seeing the update from hours to minutes.

